---
description: Protect README, docs, and changelog from collateral rewrites
globs: README.md,docs/**/*.md,CHANGELOG.md,AGENTS.md,CLAUDE.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Docs

- Prefer additive or surgical edits over full-file rewrites.
- Documentation must describe shipped behaviour.
- Measured results must identify benchmark, dataset, and backend versions.
- Illustrative numbers must never be presented as benchmark results.
- Keep `CLAUDE.md` a thin pointer to `AGENTS.md`.
- Preserve historical CHANGELOG entries.
